# CentraMCP Freeware License

> **Summary — not part of the licence terms.** CentraMCP is free to download and use for operating your own Centra e-commerce instance. You may not sell or redistribute it, or reverse engineer it beyond what the law guarantees you. It connects to your Centra instance with **your** API token and, if you enable write access, it can change live commercial data — you are responsible for the permissions you configure and for what your AI assistant does with them. The software is provided as is, without warranty, and Centra's liability is limited to the fullest extent the law allows. Centra may update or discontinue it at any time. The binding terms are below.

